id: freeze-attack
name: Freeze Attack
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCostPerBaseTier: 5
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
# A Domain Maneuver (God of a Domain (3)), a God Maneuver: open while the Domain in brackets is yours, only in God Ki, paid in Divine Ki Points.
godManeuver: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  You bend the flow of time with divine skill, allowing a single attack to catch an enemy off-guard.
text: >
  Freeze Attack [1/Round]: You bend the flow of time with divine skill, allowing a single attack to catch an enemy off-guard.
  –Maneuver Type: Instant
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –Minions: N/A
  –DKP Cost: 5(bT)
  –Effect: Target yourself or an Ally. That Character begins a Frozen Turn (see — Time Freeze) with 1 Action (instead of the 2 granted by Time Freeze). This Action must be spent on the Basic Attack Maneuver.

---

[on used]
freezeAttack();
